{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00052",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.86,
      "end_seconds": 4.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, I couldn't find the door at first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.87,
      "end_seconds": 8.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 10.13,
      "end_seconds": 13.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.69,
      "end_seconds": 16.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. We'll go through it together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.11,
      "end_seconds": 23.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "I, I wanted to get pain in my right ankle looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.28,
      "end_seconds": 25.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Does anything make it better?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.19,
      "end_seconds": 30.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "It, It settles a little with ice and rest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.21,
      "end_seconds": 35.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "How would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.42,
      "end_seconds": 43.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.55,
      "text": "Well, uh, it's... hard to say, it's kind of... I don't know—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.48,
      "end_seconds": 50.91,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "Right, take your time. Mild, moderate, or severe, if you had to pick?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.62,
      "end_seconds": 52.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "I'd say moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.01,
      "end_seconds": 55.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "How often does it happen?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.58,
      "end_seconds": 63.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "So, it's, um... not exactly... well, hard to explain, I mean—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.22,
      "end_seconds": 69.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Let me put it another way: how many times in a typical day or week?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.98,
      "end_seconds": 75.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "It's a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.4,
      "end_seconds": 81.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 81.73,
      "end_seconds": 86.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "Right, tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.59,
      "end_seconds": 92.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "I was getting to that! And, And a twist during football, too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.54,
      "end_seconds": 95.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "On a normal day, how strong is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.99,
      "end_seconds": 102.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.73,
      "text": "Well, it's... hard to say, it's kind of... I don't know—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.81,
      "end_seconds": 108.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Take your time. Mild, moderate, or severe, if you had to pick?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.31,
      "end_seconds": 110.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "I'd say mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.71,
      "end_seconds": 117.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "Have you had pain in your right ankle before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.77,
      "end_seconds": 124.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.86,
      "text": "Um, a bit, about six months ago. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.06,
      "end_seconds": 131.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.3,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any pain at the back of the heel, pop or crack or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.87,
      "end_seconds": 143.88,
      "duration_seconds": 12.01,
      "text": "No, no pain at the back of the heel, no pop or crack, no numbness. I did have bruising at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.2,
      "end_seconds": 147.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Okay, I'm following. Any pain in the knee or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.48,
      "end_seconds": 151.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.34,
      "end_seconds": 155.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.91,
      "end_seconds": 158.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "No, um, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.59,
      "end_seconds": 165.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.89,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.56,
      "end_seconds": 179.41,
      "duration_seconds": 12.85,
      "text": "I mean, I have epilepsy, for five years. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me. I've had heart failure, yes. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.6,
      "end_seconds": 187.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Yes, I can see the epilepsy in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.64,
      "end_seconds": 192.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.25,
      "end_seconds": 193.98,
      "duration_seconds": 0.73,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.51,
      "end_seconds": 210.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.83,
      "end_seconds": 218.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "My grandmother had breast cancer. My sister has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.54,
      "end_seconds": 222.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.74,
      "end_seconds": 225.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Levetiracetam, 500 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 226.1,
      "end_seconds": 233.82,
      "duration_seconds": 7.72,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the levetiracetam was 1000 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.26,
      "end_seconds": 238.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Alright, hm. Do you have the latest prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.8,
      "end_seconds": 242.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "I don't think I have it with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.94,
      "end_seconds": 249.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "It's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a small white one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.35,
      "end_seconds": 252.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 253.93,
      "end_seconds": 260.82,
      "duration_seconds": 6.89,
      "text": "For my heart, I believe. My wife sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.78,
      "end_seconds": 263.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.07,
      "end_seconds": 266.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.19,
      "end_seconds": 270.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.38,
      "end_seconds": 271.1,
      "duration_seconds": 0.72,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.93,
      "end_seconds": 284.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.75,
      "end_seconds": 287.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.11,
      "end_seconds": 291.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.6,
      "end_seconds": 301.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.62,
      "end_seconds": 322.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 16, pulse 80, temperature is 36.6 degrees, BP is 121 over 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.53,
      "end_seconds": 324.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.8,
      "end_seconds": 327.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.03,
      "end_seconds": 332.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.0,
      "end_seconds": 334.7,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.24,
      "end_seconds": 338.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "So, take a breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 356.39,
      "end_seconds": 361.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "The bones themselves aren't tender and the ankle feels stable when I test it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.02,
      "end_seconds": 366.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "A little pressure here, tell me if it's tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.05,
      "end_seconds": 388.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "There's swelling and bruising on the outer side of the ankle, tender over the ligament."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 394.43,
      "end_seconds": 412.47,
      "duration_seconds": 18.04,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. From what you've told me and what I found, my working impression is an ankle sprain. I'd also keep a small fracture in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 413.6,
      "end_seconds": 415.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Doctor, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 416.19,
      "end_seconds": 430.09,
      "duration_seconds": 13.9,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like an ankle sprain, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had pain in your right ankle, moderate, and no numbness or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 430.53,
      "end_seconds": 431.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 432.62,
      "end_seconds": 449.02,
      "duration_seconds": 16.4,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 452.84,
      "end_seconds": 454.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 455.5,
      "end_seconds": 481.22,
      "duration_seconds": 25.72,
      "text": "I'm going to order an X-ray of the ankle, for ankle injury. I'm prescribing ibuprofen, 400 milligrams, three times a day after food, for three days. It's for ankle pain. Rest, ice for twenty minutes at a time, a compression bandage and keep the foot up. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. I'd like you to see physiotherapy as well, and I'll write the referral."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 482.29,
      "end_seconds": 489.31,
      "duration_seconds": 7.02,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0071",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 490.69,
      "end_seconds": 492.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0072",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 493.31,
      "end_seconds": 499.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.95,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0073",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 500.13,
      "end_seconds": 502.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Well, got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0074",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 503.73,
      "end_seconds": 511.31,
      "duration_seconds": 7.58,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks. Let me check that I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0075",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 512.77,
      "end_seconds": 523.26,
      "duration_seconds": 10.49,
      "text": "So, uh, I take the ibuprofen, 400 milligrams, three times a day after food and come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0076",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 524.62,
      "end_seconds": 529.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we've covered it. Do you have any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0077",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 530.04,
      "end_seconds": 531.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Thanks so much, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0078",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
